msgid "High Definition Live Video FPV Systems"
msgstr "高清实时视频 FPV 系统"

#: ../../source/docs/common-video-landingpage.rst:7
#: ffb9bb837462419e847aee83f280467c
msgid ""
"This sections covers live video systems which can provide a high definition "
"(HD) first-person video (FPV) from the vehicle back to either a ground "
"station or FPV goggles. For other standard definition (SD) FPV systems, see "
":ref:`common-fpv-first-person-view` section."
msgstr ""
"本节涵盖可以将高清（HD）第一人称视角（FPV）视频从飞行器传回地面站或 FPV 眼镜的实时视频系统。对于其他标清（SD）FPV 系统，请参见 "
":ref:`common-fpv-first-person-view` 章节。"

